Q","commit":{"author":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T10:54:28Z"},"committer":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T10:54:28Z"},"message":"feat(file-picker): open dialogs in a picked folder given as a KmpFile\n\ninitialDirectory is a String that means a path on Desktop and a URI on Android,\nso code passing a picked folder had to know which. FilePickerSettings and\nrememberFilePickerSettings now have overloads that take the folder as a KmpFile\nand hand it to each platform in its own form.\n\niOS used to ignore initialDirectory; the document picker and the save dialog\nnow open in it through directoryURL. The String overloads are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"f932d126f065d4f29038fdd6eed62063951c9330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/trees/f932d126f065d4f29038fdd6eed62063951c9330"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/commits/03cbf0cc1be7b2c9ccb6a30b1bd2744810a6f944","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/03cbf0cc1be7b2c9ccb6a30b1bd2744810a6f944","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/03cbf0cc1be7b2c9ccb6a30b1bd2744810a6f944","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/03cbf0cc1be7b2c9ccb6a30b1bd2744810a6f944/comments","author":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b82e19d9639d617b2a1d44df9ba22f6314fc7ad7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/b82e19d9639d617b2a1d44df9ba22f6314fc7ad7","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/b82e19d9639d617b2a1d44df9ba22f6314fc7ad7"}]},{"sha":"ed7e1e6f2fdf2baad645bd25779e57d6192a5eef","node_id":"C_kwDOKDql7toAKGVkN2UxZTZmMmZkZjJiYWFkNjQ1YmQyNTc3OWU1N2Q2MTkyYTVlZWY","commit":{"author":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T11:04:15Z"},"committer":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T11:04:15Z"},"message":"feat(io): KmpFile.fromUriString, getSize and getMimeType\n\nfromUriString reads back what toUriString returns, so an app can store a file or\nfolder and reopen it; it also accepts an absolute path. getSize and getMimeType\ncover the common upload checks: Android asks the content provider, iOS and\nDesktop the file system and the extension, the web what the browser reports.\n\nThe sample keeps its chosen initial folder as a URI string in rememberSaveable\nand shows each picked file's size and type. calf-io gets Robolectric host tests,\nwhich also cover the Android getPath change.\n\nThe iOS MIME lookup is not unit tested: the simulator test process has no\nUniform Type database, so even UTTypePDF reports no MIME type there.","tree":{"sha":"9e782d4d0c596554a390210fbd2ea7e015f01000","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/trees/9e782d4d0c596554a390210fbd2ea7e015f01000"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/commits/ed7e1e6f2fdf2baad645bd25779e57d6192a5eef","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/ed7e1e6f2fdf2baad645bd25779e57d6192a5eef","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/ed7e1e6f2fdf2baad645bd25779e57d6192a5eef","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/ed7e1e6f2fdf2baad645bd25779e57d6192a5eef/comments","author":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"03cbf0cc1be7b2c9ccb6a30b1bd2744810a6f944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/03cbf0cc1be7b2c9ccb6a30b1bd2744810a6f944","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/03cbf0cc1be7b2c9ccb6a30b1bd2744810a6f944"}]},{"sha":"ff62e5b21e6801e11b5f1cdfd1ff2d0b3c658652","node_id":"C_kwDOKDql7toAKGZmNjJlNWIyMWU2ODAxZTExYjVmMWNkZmQxZmYyZDBiM2M2NTg2NTI","commit":{"author":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T11:07:12Z"},"committer":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T11:07:12Z"},"message":"feat(file-picker): real save dialog on the web where the browser has one\n\nThe web saver only triggered an <a download>, so the browser decided where the\nfile went and the app never heard back. It now uses the File System Access save\ndialog (window.showSaveFilePicker) when the browser has it, Chrome, Edge and\nother Chromium browsers: the user picks the location, the file is written\nthrough a writable stream, and onResult receives the saved file, or null on\ncancel.\n\nSafari and Firefox have no save dialog API, so they keep the download; so does a\nbrowser that refuses the dialog, for example without a user gesture.","tree":{"sha":"ec16cc256d0710476996a2fdc2cb5673fdc972b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/trees/ec16cc256d0710476996a2fdc2cb5673fdc972b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/commits/ff62e5b21e6801e11b5f1cdfd1ff2d0b3c658652","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/ff62e5b21e6801e11b5f1cdfd1ff2d0b3c658652","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/ff62e5b21e6801e11b5f1cdfd1ff2d0b3c658652","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/ff62e5b21e6801e11b5f1cdfd1ff2d0b3c658652/comments","author":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ed7e1e6f2fdf2baad645bd25779e57d6192a5eef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/ed7e1e6f2fdf2baad645bd25779e57d6192a5eef","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/ed7e1e6f2fdf2baad645bd25779e57d6192a5eef"}]},{"sha":"1a20b609aa159f52cb9841fe75afc15e0fe4edc6","node_id":"C_kwDOKDql7toAKDFhMjBiNjA5YWExNTlmNTJjYjk4NDFmZTc1YWZjMTVlMGZlNGVkYzY","commit":{"author":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T11:17:14Z"},"committer":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T11:17:14Z"},"message":"feat(file-picker): onError overloads for the picker and saver launchers\n\nFailures used to be invisible or fatal: picked files that could not be copied\nwere dropped on iOS, a missing documents app crashed the Android picker, a\nDesktop dialog that could not be created made the picker do nothing, and a\nfailed save looked like a cancellation.\n\nrememberFilePickerLauncher and rememberFileSaverLauncher (and the Desktop\nFrameWindowScope picker) now have overloads with\nonError: (FilePickerException) -> Unit. Cancelling stays an onResult value.\nWhen only some picked files fail, onError is called once and onResult still\ngets the readable ones. A failed save is reported only through onError.\n\nThe existing overloads keep their behaviour: the picker ignores failures, and\nthe saver reports them as null.","tree":{"sha":"919514aa8116de83399918e78883086f2cb6db68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/trees/919514aa8116de83399918e78883086f2cb6db68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/commits/1a20b609aa159f52cb9841fe75afc15e0fe4edc6","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/1a20b609aa159f52cb9841fe75afc15e0fe4edc6","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/1a20b609aa159f52cb9841fe75afc15e0fe4edc6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/1a20b609aa159f52cb9841fe75afc15e0fe4edc6/comments","author":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/f