":{"author":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T14:02:22Z"},"committer":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-15T14:02:22Z"},"message":"feat(io): keep access to picked files across restarts with bookmarks\n\nKmpFile.createBookmark returns a string to store, KmpFile.fromBookmark reopens\nit, and releaseBookmark gives the access up.\n\nAndroid takes and releases a persisted URI permission, and fromBookmark returns\nnull once it is gone. iOS stores Foundation bookmark data; the reopened file\nstarts its security-scoped access at once and holds it until releaseBookmark,\nfollowing FileKit's finding (#667) that access started per operation on rebuilt\npaths fails after a device restart. Desktop stores the path; the web has no\nbookmarks.\n\niOS source() now opens the file inside its security-scoped access. The sample\nkeeps its initial folder as a bookmark, falling back to the URI.","tree":{"sha":"d7a0a42434d57d7b20025adbb6e5cb5b15d1e1e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/trees/d7a0a42434d57d7b20025adbb6e5cb5b15d1e1e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/commits/c70d35c568265aed8a673e59e0e24fc0126f0d09","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/c70d35c568265aed8a673e59e0e24fc0126f0d09","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/c70d35c568265aed8a673e59e0e24fc0126f0d09","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/c70d35c568265aed8a673e59e0e24fc0126f0d09/comments","author":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"1a20b609aa159f52cb9841fe75afc15e0fe4edc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/1a20b609aa159f52cb9841fe75afc15e0fe4edc6","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/1a20b609aa159f52cb9841fe75afc15e0fe4edc6"}]},{"sha":"66e345a9b291d4d82aa76b1f5f0d05e99b1bb8e1","node_id":"C_kwDOKDql7toAKDY2ZTM0NWE5YjI5MWQ0ZDgyYWE3NmIxZjVmMGQwNWU5OWIxYmI4ZTE","commit":{"author":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-18T05:40:10Z"},"committer":{"name":"MohamedRejeb","email":"mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-18T05:40:10Z"},"message":"fix(file-picker): keep the web download's blob URL alive for Safari\n\nThe download fallback revoked the object URL right after the click.\nSafari reads the blob after the click returns and could fail the\ndownload, so the URL is now revoked after 40 s, as FileSaver.js does.\n\nDocs: Chrome on Android 132+ gets the save dialog, and Safari/Firefox\nusers can turn on their browser's ask-where-to-save setting.","tree":{"sha":"80949bbc72a314d7fe512c2e9156c31f302d54d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/trees/80949bbc72a314d7fe512c2e9156c31f302d54d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/commits/66e345a9b291d4d82aa76b1f5f0d05e99b1bb8e1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/66e345a9b291d4d82aa76b1f5f0d05e99b1bb8e1","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commit/66e345a9b291d4d82aa76b1f5f0d05e99b1bb8e1","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/commits/66e345a9b291d4d82aa76b1f5f0d05e99b1bb8e1/comments","author":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscr